atomcode — https://atomgit.com/atomgit_atomcode/atomcode
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Portions of `src/turnstile/kernel/` are a Python port of the `atomcode-kernel`
crate: the turn/round loop engine, the port and DTO definitions, the lifecycle
hook and tool-middleware seams, the StopReason set, and the test doubles in
`kernel/testkit.py` (ported from `atomcode-kernel/src/testkit.rs`).

